  "description": "TIQDUV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C140 H144 N12 O22 Tb4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.603-3.900 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.72-112.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C140H144N12O22Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
